{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/bf25d8cba4beb22ad88ee0e4f1971589.poster.avif?t=1764343856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/bf25d8cba4beb22ad88ee0e4f1971589.webm?t=1764343856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/bf25d8cba4beb22ad88ee0e4f1971589.mp4?t=1764343856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiji stole from his colleague, thus he has been cursed, until he can pay off his debt. Help Jiji collect enough money by scouring difficult yet pretty biomes, and free him from his curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/d519a00b285ab0e3fa88733ced00d455.poster.avif?t=1764343856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/d519a00b285ab0e3fa88733ced00d455.webm?t=1764343856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996590/extras/d519a00b285ab0e3fa88733ced00d455.mp4?t=1764343856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way through a multitude of levels across various rooms and biomes, featuring a unique core mechanic, dozens of interactables, tight controls, hard jumps, followed by even harder jumps.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No walking or running, you can only propel yourself through bombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactable, which change how your character moves and behaves.</p></l